{"id":"en_fake-boss-real-trouble","title":"Fake Boss, Real Trouble","titleEn":"Fake Boss, Real Trouble","description":"To satisfy his uncle, Duan Xu, who chairs Shenghua Group, brought Sun Fanghua on board. Once in position, she misused her authority by dismissing employees and installing incompetent family members in their places, actions that brought the company to the brink of being sold off. Duan Xu made it back in the nick of time, drove her out, saw both her and his competitor put behind bars, and took the business public. Fake Boss, Real Trouble can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fake-boss-real-trouble/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fake-boss-real-trouble/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identity Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqku/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fake-boss-real-trouble_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqku/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-boss-real-trouble_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqku/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-boss-real-trouble_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqku/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-boss-real-trouble_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnqku/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fake-boss-real-trouble_5","title":"E